@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber

actor Utente
participant HomeFragment
participant AddLocationDialogFragment
participant Geocoder
participant LocationRepository
participant WeatherApiService
database "Open-Meteo API" as API
participant LocationAdapter

== Aggiunta Nuova Città ==

Utente -> HomeFragment : Clicca aggiungi città
HomeFragment -> AddLocationDialogFragment : show()
Utente -> AddLocationDialogFragment : Inserisce nome città e clicca "Aggiungi"
AddLocationDialogFragment -> HomeFragment : onDialogPositiveClick(cityName)

== Risoluzione Coordinate ==

HomeFragment -> Geocoder : getFromLocationName(cityName)
Geocoder --> HomeFragment : List<Address> (lat, lon)

== Recupero Dati e Salvataggio ==

HomeFragment -> LocationRepository : saveLocations(locations)
HomeFragment -> WeatherApiService : getForecast(lat, lon, ...)
WeatherApiService -> API : Request meteo data
API --> WeatherApiService : Response (JSON)
WeatherApiService --> HomeFragment : onResponse(OpenMeteoResponse)

== Aggiornamento Interfaccia ==

HomeFragment -> LocationAdapter : notifyDataSetChanged()
LocationAdapter --> Utente : Visualizza dati della nuova città

@enduml